                    ArbitraryRoundCone a=(-0.45, -1.5, -0.29) b=(-2.27, 5.57, -1.46) radiusA=0.57 radiusB=0.26
                    ArbitraryRoundCone a=(-0.06, -1.5, -0.45) b=(-0.32, 3.45, -2.27) radiusA=0.57 radiusB=0.26
